This project has two independent codelines, both pure TypeScript modules tested with vitest:
- mocka (fare logic) — source in `src/fares.ts`, tests in `test/fares.test.ts`. Exports `fareFor`, `totalFor`, `BASE_FARE_CENTS`, `CONCESSION_FARE_CENTS`. The `Rider` type is `{ age: number; hasPass: boolean }`. Test command: `vitest run`. Type-check: `tsc --noEmit`.
